    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey of vengeance as you uncover the secrets lurking in the shadows of history. \u00a0Get ready for an epic adventure filled with twists and surprises, where every choice can lead to glory or despair!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Rebirth, Revenge, Roguelike</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tang Dynasty Myth, Hardcore Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/0a071215fafd632902ef8b80b3540dba.avif?t=1753698458\" width=720 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >751 CE: The \u2018Stone\u2019 Kingdom falls. Its princess dies <i>from</i>\u00a0poison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >756 CE: The An-Shi Rebellion erupts, the An Lushan Rebellion shatters Tang glory, unraveling a saga that bends history itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the princess from the \u2018Stone\u2019 Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Princess needs no mercy\u2014only her blade. \u00a0Rise, fight, evolve\u2014and rewrite your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/197800338a5b0f4e123662ef3382dbf3.poster.avif?t=1753698458\" width=640 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/197800338a5b0f4e123662ef3382dbf3.webm?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/197800338a5b0f4e123662ef3382dbf3.mp4?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chinese Aesthetics, Sensory Overload\uff01 </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/177fe3652a82caae4ab9147f5d0badac.avif?t=1753698458\" width=720 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VISUALS: Porcelain-inspired UI, haunting BGM that hijacks your pulse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STORY: Morally complex narratives where Chinese folklore bleeds into reality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WORLD: Under the cursed moon, the rules shift with the tides:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full moon? \u00a0Demons run wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New moon? \u00a0Humanity\u2019s darkness takes form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive blood rituals in sunless pits, or lose yourself in Chang\u2019an\u2019s ghostly markets\u2014no two runs play the same!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/0b5ef6b7ca42a46ddde96c43412d1415.poster.avif?t=1753698458\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/0b5ef6b7ca42a46ddde96c43412d1415.webm?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/0b5ef6b7ca42a46ddde96c43412d1415.mp4?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Souls, Skills, Strategy</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Phantom of the Opera, Blood Sacrifices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/59632f9e0f1f9e9d0b8cf24dc343a36a.avif?t=1753698458\" width=720 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choice: Trick demons as a cursed puppeteer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mend a ghost\u2019s broken past\u2026 or exploit it?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient rituals stir\u2014blood as currency, souls as stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices rewrite destiny, puzzles hide deadly secrets, and absurd tales stitch the web of your doom\u2014or glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/99f0226a49ebf34aa3106c81518c8895.poster.avif?t=1753698458\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/99f0226a49ebf34aa3106c81518c8895.webm?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/99f0226a49ebf34aa3106c81518c8895.mp4?t=1753698458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight through 5 realms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/f99fcb58cbf97b25c9397b07f566e327.avif?t=1753698458\" width=720 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destination: The Underworld\u2019s rivers, The golden streets of ancient China, Your fallen homeland\u2019s ruins. \u00a0Slaughter all who dare stand in your way\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge with historical figures to inherit their unique powers. \u00a0Activate elemental formations to reshape your rebirth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart\u00a0combos mean unstoppable dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Combat ,Collect and Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432500/extras/b2db94d811adc9c8dddc84ba8016a7c3.avif?t=1753698458\" width=720 height=162 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 weapons, seamless switching</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ relics and offerings, endless synergies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New soul fragments to unlock, every run a fresh gamble</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Spirit Characters deliver fresh moves every fight\u2014never hit repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ elemental skills across 5 schools let you craft combos that feel alive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a symphony of slaughter\u2014fast, fluid, and fiercely satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No grind, all thrill\u2014explore infinite builds, master the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moon rises. The drums begin. The stage is set.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wield your sword to open a world of endless possibility.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a pawn in the mirror\u2019s game\u2026 or wield its power to rewrite your own ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin and Love\u2014where death is just the first act of your godlike revenge.</p>",
